                422 MOV, ProRes 4444 MOV, and APNG; WebM remains available from editor
                and CLI export.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article>
              <h3>Replay Buffer</h3>
              <p>
                Replay Buffer settings control the enable toggle, clip length, 24 or 30 FPS,
